    {
      "id": "p0180-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The translation spreadsheet includes an odd line related to the Undyne battle that simply says \"Hamburger Helpers\". Toby noted that this line seems to be unused in the actual game. It's likely an old error message he used while developing Underta/e. Still, the translator localized it just to be safe.",
        "raw": "The translation spreadsheet includes an odd line related to the Undyne battle\nthat simply says \"Hamburger Helpers\". Toby noted that this line seems to\nbe unused in the actual game. It's likely an old error message he used while\ndeveloping Underta/e. Still, the translator localized it just to be safe.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29672911,
          0.23970714,
          0.89360999,
          0.30574286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29468573,
          0.23899286,
          0.91219451,
          0.30681429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          6,
          7,
          8,
          9
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "翻译表里有一句与 Undyne 战斗有关的怪话，只有“Hamburger Helpers”。Toby 注明，这句话似乎没有在实际游戏中使用，可能是开发 Undertale 时遗留的错误提示。不过，为保险起见，译者还是做了本地化。",
        "status": "draft",
