    {
      "id": "p0180-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The phrase \"the wind is howling\" appears before, during, and after the battle with Undyne. Toby included this short, ominous message as a reference to the classic Japanese RPG Chrono Trigger. In the game, a villain named Magus shares two memorable lines: \"the black wind begins to blow\" and \"the black wind howls\".",
        "raw": "The phrase \"the wind is howling\" appears before, during, and after the battle with\nUndyne. Toby included this short, ominous message as a reference to the classic\nJapanese RPG Chrono Trigger. In the game, a villain named Magus shares two\nmemorable lines: \"the black wind begins to blow\" and \"the black wind howls\".",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29679041,
          0.59576429,
          0.91015113,
          0.66315
        ],
